  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "David Beck said in an October 16, 2025 reported statement that he fully expects AI to increasingly become an indispensable tool for NNSA. In undated written answers to the Senate Armed Services Committee, Beck said that if confirmed he would continue NNSA’s commitment to acquiring computational capabilities supporting advanced AI for nuclear simulations, and that he would evaluate AI and machine learning applications across Defense Programs’ mission space. He also described potential AI uses such as optimizing experimental designs, analyzing diagnostic data, and improving facility operations, and said he would work to leverage AI, machine learning, and advanced manufacturing for national security missions if confirmed.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s3",
    "s4"
   ],
   "sentences": [
